{"seq":1,"slug":"markdown-timing-depth-elasticity","title":"markdown 时机/深度/频次弹性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-decision-optimization/markdown-timing-depth-elasticity","wordCount":2258,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"markdown-时机-深度-频次弹性模型\">markdown 时机/深度/频次弹性模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>清仓降价的三个参数——<strong>何时降（时机）、降多少（深度）、降几次（频次）</strong>——之所以必须一起优化，是因为它们互相决定对方的成本。降得深可以少降几次，但会一次性放弃所有本可正价成交的销量；分多次浅降可以榨取更多消费者剩余，但每次都让一批本来会正价买的顾客等到下一次折扣。降得太晚窗口不够，太早则把尚在正价的销量提前折扣掉。</p>\n<p>这三者的共同底层是<strong>价格弹性</strong>：需求对价格的响应强度。弹性估得准，时机问题就退化成&quot;在剩余窗口内，每次降价能多卖出多少&quot;的算术；弹性估得偏差，再精巧的优化也只是在错误的曲线上求极值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[识别: 账龄/WOS/截止线] --&gt; B[估计价格弹性]&#10;  B --&gt; C{降价分几次?}&#10;  C --&gt;|一次到位| D[本地响应快&lt;br/&gt;但放弃梯度顾客]&#10;  C --&gt;|多次渐进| E[捕获不同价格敏感度&lt;br/&gt;但顾客学会等待]&#10;  D --&gt; F[选择首次降价时点 t1]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[每次降幅 d_i]&#10;  G --&gt; H[输出降价计划&lt;br/&gt;档位/生效时间/适用批次]&#10;  H --&gt; I[促销引擎执行]\">graph TD\n  A[识别: 账龄/WOS/截止线] --&gt; B[估计价格弹性]\n  B --&gt; C{降价分几次?}\n  C --&gt;|一次到位| D[本地响应快&lt;br/&gt;但放弃梯度顾客]\n  C --&gt;|多次渐进| E[捕获不同价格敏感度&lt;br/&gt;但顾客学会等待]\n  D --&gt; F[选择首次降价时点 t1]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[每次降幅 d_i]\n  G --&gt; H[输出降价计划&lt;br/&gt;档位/生效时间/适用批次]\n  H --&gt; I[促销引擎执行]</pre><h2 id=\"价格弹性的估计与陷阱\">价格弹性的估计与陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"弹性的定义与清仓语境\">弹性的定义与清仓语境</h3><p>价格弹性标准定义为需求变化率与价格变化率之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\frac{\\%\\Delta Q}{\\%\\Delta P} = \\frac{\\Delta Q / Q}{\\Delta P / P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1686em;vertical-align:-0.7416em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">%Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">%Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7416em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>清仓语境下要的是<strong>当前价格带的局部弹性</strong>，而不是整条需求曲线的平均弹性。原因很实际：清仓的降价幅度通常落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 区间，而正常经营期的历史价格波动可能只覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>，用它外推深度折扣会严重高估销量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用自然实验而非历史相关来估弹性\">用自然实验而非历史相关来估弹性</h3><p>最危险的估计方法是&quot;用历史销量对历史价格做回归&quot;。它把三个效应混在一起：价格效应、季节效应、以及<strong>价格与需求的同时性偏差</strong>（卖得好所以涨价，于是回归会显示&quot;越贵越好卖&quot;）。更可靠的是利用<strong>外生价格变动</strong>：竞品调价、限时促销、优惠券投放这类与本品需求无关的变化，做双重差分或用工具变量。清仓系统没有条件每次都做实验，退而求其次的做法是建立<strong>价格档位的历史响应库</strong>：按品类 × 折扣档位统计平均提升系数，作为弹性的先验。</p>\n<h3 id=\"弹性的品类差异\">弹性的品类差异</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>典型弹性形态</th>\n<th>清仓启示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快时尚服装</td>\n<td>高弹性，折扣敏感度强</td>\n<td>深度折扣能显著提速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生鲜临期</td>\n<td>极高弹性，接近&quot;全有或全无&quot;</td>\n<td>折扣的边际效用递减快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>家电数码</td>\n<td>中等弹性，比较型购买</td>\n<td>需配合曝光，光降价无效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奢侈品/轻奢</td>\n<td>低弹性，价格即信号</td>\n<td>宁可处置也不深折</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>奢侈品这一类揭示了弹性模型的边界：当价格本身承载品牌信号时，降价可能<strong>同时</strong>降低销量（因为失去身份价值）。这类商品的清仓必须换渠道而非降价，见 <a href=\"clearance-margin-brand-price-guard\">清仓毛利回收与品牌价格保护</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时机-什么时候启动第一次降价\">时机：什么时候启动第一次降价</h2><h3 id=\"时机问题的本质是窗口与流速的匹配\">时机问题的本质是窗口与流速的匹配</h3><p>首次降价时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的选择可以还原成一个简单问题：<strong>若维持现价，能否在截止前清完？</strong> 若不能，就需要在窗口内留出足够的下折促销时间。设剩余窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 周、当前 WOS 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，则缺口比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = 1 - W/w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>。缺口越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应越早，且首次降幅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应越大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def first_markdown_week(weeks_of_supply, window_weeks, min_response_weeks=2):&#10;    if weeks_of_supply &lt;= window_weeks:&#10;        return None                      # 无缺口，不降&#10;    gap = 1 - window_weeks / weeks_of_supply&#10;    # 缺口越大越早启动；但至少留 min_response_weeks 让折扣产生效果&#10;    lead = max(min_response_weeks, round(window_weeks * (1 - gap)))&#10;    return max(0, window_weeks - lead)   # 相对窗口起点的降价周次\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> first_markdown_week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(weeks_of_supply, window_weeks, min_response_weeks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weeks_of_supply </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window_weeks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # 无缺口，不降</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window_weeks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weeks_of_supply</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 缺口越大越早启动；但至少留 min_response_weeks 让折扣产生效果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lead </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(min_response_weeks, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(window_weeks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, window_weeks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lead)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 相对窗口起点的降价周次</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"为什么-降得越早越好-是错的\">为什么&quot;降得越早越好&quot;是错的</h3><p>过早降价放弃的是<strong>正价销售的销量</strong>，这部分销量的毛利最高。因此时机优化是在&quot;折扣带来的增量销量&quot;与&quot;被折扣掉的原价销量&quot;之间求平衡。这引入了 markdown 时机问题的一个结构性困难：<strong>反事实不可观测</strong>。我们看不到&quot;如果不降价会怎样&quot;，只能靠模型推断。这也是为什么 markdown 决策系统通常对时机更保守（宁可略晚），而对深度更激进（一旦决定降，就降够）。</p>\n<p>数据驱动的时机决策在理论上也有代价：当需求模型参数未知、需要在多轮中边学边降时，<strong>单调的降价约束会增加学习成本</strong>（regret），因为不能自由探索价格空间（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.15286\">Jia, Li, Ravi, &quot;Markdown Pricing Under an Unknown Parametric Demand Model&quot;, arXiv:2312.15286</a>）。实务含义是：不要指望一个在线学习系统在几轮之内就找到最优时机，前几轮的降价更多是信息代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度与频次-分几次降-每次降多少\">深度与频次：分几次降、每次降多少</h2><h3 id=\"梯度定价与顾客等待\">梯度定价与顾客等待</h3><p>分多次降价的经济学依据是<strong>顾客的价格敏感度异质</strong>：愿意全价的顾客在首次降价前就买了，价格敏感的顾客等待折扣。多档折扣让不同敏感度的顾客在各自愿意支付的价格点成交。代价是<strong>策略性等待</strong>——一旦顾客预期还会再降，正价需求会前移到折扣点。</p>\n<p>连续降价（如每周固定幅度）会让等待变得极具吸引力，最终把所有需求都推到最后一档，等于只卖了一个低价。因此实务上的频次通常很少：<strong>2–4 档</strong>，档位之间的间隔足以让当档需求消化掉，而不是让顾客无限等待。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降幅的档位设计\">降幅的档位设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;markdown_plan_id&quot;: &quot;MP-2026Q4-APPAREL-001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;category_id&quot;: 2043, &quot;age_bucket&quot;: &quot;61_90&quot;, &quot;min_wos_weeks&quot;: 20 },&#10;  &quot;tiers&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;tier&quot;: 1, &quot;discount_pct&quot;: 25, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;gap_ratio &gt;= 0.20&quot;, &quot;min_days_between&quot;: 14 },&#10;    { &quot;tier&quot;: 2, &quot;discount_pct&quot;: 40, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;sell_through_t1 &lt; 0.60&quot;, &quot;min_days_between&quot;: 14 },&#10;    { &quot;tier&quot;: 3, &quot;discount_pct&quot;: 55, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;weeks_to_deadline &lt;= 4&quot;, &quot;min_days_between&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;tier&quot;: 4, &quot;discount_pct&quot;: 75, &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;weeks_to_deadline &lt;= 2&quot;, &quot;min_days_between&quot;: 0 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;guardrails&quot;: { &quot;floor_margin_pct&quot;: -15, &quot;brand_price_floor_index&quot;: 0.35 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"markdown_plan_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MP-2026Q4-APPAREL-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"category_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2043</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"age_bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"61_90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_wos_weeks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tiers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"discount_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gap_ratio >= 0.20\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_days_between\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"discount_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sell_through_t1 &#x3C; 0.60\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_days_between\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"discount_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"weeks_to_deadline &#x3C;= 4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_days_between\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"discount_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"weeks_to_deadline &#x3C;= 2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_days_between\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"guardrails\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"floor_margin_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"brand_price_floor_index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键不是具体数字，而是三个结构：<strong>触发条件是状态量而非日历</strong>（避免&quot;到了某天就降&quot;这种无视真实进展的做法）、<strong>相邻档位有最小间隔</strong>（防止顾客等待并保护每档的消化时间）、以及<strong>档位同时受毛利率与品牌价格底线约束</strong>（第 3 篇的主题）。第四档的 <code>min_days_between: 0</code> 表达的是&quot;这是最后手段&quot;，现实中它常常意味着该走渠道分流而非继续降价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"档位之间的决策是状态相关的\">档位之间的决策是状态相关的</h3><p>档位不是预设的时间表，而是策略：进不进下一档，取决于当前档的实际售罄率。若第一档的售罄率超出预期，就应该<strong>停在这里</strong>，而不是机械执行第二档。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Full: 进入候选池&#10;  Full --&gt; T1: WOS 缺口 &gt;= 20%&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2: T1 售罄率 &lt; 60% 且窗口 &gt; 4 周&#10;  T1 --&gt; Hold: T1 售罄率 &gt;= 80%&#10;  T2 --&gt; T3: 距截止 &lt;= 4 周&#10;  T2 --&gt; Hold: 售罄率达标&#10;  T3 --&gt; Channel: 距截止 &lt;= 2 周且未清完&#10;  T3 --&gt; Hold: 清完&#10;  Hold --&gt; Full: 下一季需求回升&#10;  Channel --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Full: 进入候选池\n  Full --&gt; T1: WOS 缺口 &gt;= 20%\n  T1 --&gt; T2: T1 售罄率 &lt; 60% 且窗口 &gt; 4 周\n  T1 --&gt; Hold: T1 售罄率 &gt;= 80%\n  T2 --&gt; T3: 距截止 &lt;= 4 周\n  T2 --&gt; Hold: 售罄率达标\n  T3 --&gt; Channel: 距截止 &lt;= 2 周且未清完\n  T3 --&gt; Hold: 清完\n  Hold --&gt; Full: 下一季需求回升\n  Channel --&gt; [*]</pre><p><code>Hold</code> 状态是这个状态机里最容易被忽略的一环：它承认&quot;降价策略可能已经奏效，应该停止继续降&quot;。缺少 Hold 的系统会沿着预设阶梯一路降到底，把本可保留的毛利送掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大规模组合优化-当单品决策变成百万单品\">大规模组合优化：当单品决策变成百万单品</h2><p>单品层面的时机/深度/频次逻辑清晰，但真实清仓面对的是<strong>数百万 SKU 的组合问题</strong>：总预算有限、总仓储有限、各 SKU 的降价互相影响（同品类内互相蚕食）。这时单品规则退化为约束条件，整体变成一个大规模混合整数优化。</p>\n<p>工业化实践中，直接求精确解不可行，主流做法是<strong>分解 + 启发式</strong>：把大问题按某种结构拆成可并行求解的子问题，再用启发式补足分解产生的整数性缺口。Zalando 公开的做法是把拉格朗日分解与原启发式、以及一种启发式割平面生成方法结合，产出&quot;近似最优&quot;的解，部署在数百万商品的目录上（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.02996\">Streeck 等, &quot;Tricks from the Trade for Large-Scale Markdown Pricing&quot;, arXiv:2404.02996</a>）。</p>\n<p>对自建系统的启示有三点：其一，不要指望单一模型直接输出全网最优价，分层（品类策略 → SKU 参数 → 执行）更现实；其二，单品规则的<strong>可解释性</strong>在大规模系统里是优点而非缺点，因为它让业务能定位问题环节；其三，组合约束（预算、仓储、蚕食）应作为<strong>边界条件</strong>注入单品决策，而不是事后全局裁剪——事后裁剪会破坏单品计划的时间结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时机、深度、频次是一组耦合参数，共同底层是<strong>当前价格带的局部弹性</strong>；用正常经营期的历史回归外推深度折扣会系统性高估销量。</li>\n<li>弹性估计应优先利用外生价格变动（竞品调价、活动投放），退而求其次建立品类 × 折扣档位的历史响应库作为先验。</li>\n<li>首次降价时机取决于&quot;维持现价能否在截止前清完&quot;的缺口比例；宁可略晚不要过早，但一旦决定降就应降够。</li>\n<li>频次通常只有 2–4 档：太少无法捕获异质顾客，太多会培养策略性等待，把需求全推到最后一档。</li>\n<li>降价阶梯必须是<strong>状态驱动的状态机</strong>，且必须包含 Hold 分支——承认&quot;策略已奏效，停止继续降&quot;。</li>\n<li>大规模组合（百万 SKU、预算/仓储/蚕食约束）通常用分解 + 启发式求近似最优，单品规则作为分层结构中的可解释中间层。</li>\n<li>深度的下界由毛利与品牌约束给出，见 <a href=\"clearance-margin-brand-price-guard\">清仓毛利回收与品牌价格保护</a>；清仓路径规划见 <a href=\"stock-to-go-clearance-curve\">stock-to-go 与清仓曲线</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"markdown 时机/深度/频次弹性模型","id":"markdown-时机-深度-频次弹性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价格弹性的估计与陷阱","id":"价格弹性的估计与陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"弹性的定义与清仓语境","id":"弹性的定义与清仓语境"},{"level":3,"text":"用自然实验而非历史相关来估弹性","id":"用自然实验而非历史相关来估弹性"},{"level":3,"text":"弹性的品类差异","id":"弹性的品类差异"},{"level":2,"text":"时机：什么时候启动第一次降价","id":"时机-什么时候启动第一次降价"},{"level":3,"text":"时机问题的本质是窗口与流速的匹配","id":"时机问题的本质是窗口与流速的匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么\"降得越早越好\"是错的","id":"为什么-降得越早越好-是错的"},{"level":2,"text":"深度与频次：分几次降、每次降多少","id":"深度与频次-分几次降-每次降多少"},{"level":3,"text":"梯度定价与顾客等待","id":"梯度定价与顾客等待"},{"level":3,"text":"降幅的档位设计","id":"降幅的档位设计"},{"level":3,"text":"档位之间的决策是状态相关的","id":"档位之间的决策是状态相关的"},{"level":2,"text":"大规模组合优化：当单品决策变成百万单品","id":"大规模组合优化-当单品决策变成百万单品"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"效期/季节/过季风险（联164）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/lifecycle-deadstock-detect/expiry-seasonal-obsolescence-risk"},"next":{"title":"stock-to-go 与清仓曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-decision-optimization/stock-to-go-clearance-curve"}}